ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ak3_fiSvl-IQ7kNvwEB2oKs&_nc_oc=Adpd4Kp7Zjn5ZUPyL4SjZClxCvlp3eaU_SqAbOYqAU12VLNQKHOTU4wnHKE3qOUL0AE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8qxXb_Lhv37nFvBKuF4udMEptiJV2hp7qtMMfbNNhwdg&oe=6A3169FC"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y8fKLEuKZYEQ7kNvwEjBpZL&_nc_oc=AdqanwAUL7DRa-uPmqDrpOUNEGzhptg7oFUYdEU0UBYLIzvvGTGV6ZZJNWhD7xeiCwI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8GzSUPi7m7TzpGuTsLwdHjA-h_0oWwAfNjHhGsoqngPw&oe=6A314E16"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vxqFnpgOu8EQ7kNvwGBYDYz&_nc_oc=Adp6SBrXJkzKkwABqdu614FLzafLGfPgwSIGQNihTXM3TQrQv-OuQNDp3tx3_pAJZ24&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-ZQNZKSssA6q8l5XbMGjLJvb4n9_o2fIoq_9kkIY6WQA&oe=6A315BE4"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_